<title>POLAND: Rolimpex Q1 net falls to PLN 4.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex Q1 net falls to PLN 4.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rolimpex preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			24.73 vs     24.05</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.60 vs     14.90</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.60 vs	9.46</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Rolimpex SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				403.71 vs    303.72</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 342.82 vs    252.74</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.01 loss</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.61 vs	5.45</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     5.21 vs	1.51</p>
<p>    financial costs			 23.73 vs     10.65</p>
<p>    investment				12.48 vs	7.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
